From: sunshineinabox <aqemail@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 18 Sep 2026 14:52:13 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] rendervulkan: composite a single layer with a rotated blit

With --composite-blit or GAMESCOPE_COMPOSITE_BLIT=1, a frame with exactly one
unscaled sRGB layer is copied to the output with a transfer blit, rotated
with VK_QCOM_rotated_copy_commands when the output is rotated. It skips
colour management, like direct scanout of that layer. Anything else takes
the normal composite path.
---
